chapter.v:
	My son, 

	 do not forget my law,But let your heart keep my commands;
 [2 Kin. 25:1-12; Jer. 52:4; Ezek.]

	Trust in 

	 the Lord with all your heart,And lean not on your own understanding;
 [Jer. 21:7; 32:4; 38:18, 23 f 2 Kin. 23:33; Jer. 52:9,]

	Honor the 

	 Lord with your possessions,And with the firstfruits of all your increase;
 [2 Kin. 25:8, 11, 12, 20 n Jer. 38:19]
